  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop an in-depth understanding of the approaches to humanitarian aid of a number of selected emerging donor countries. This will provide the tools for a detailed analysis of obstacles to and opportunities for cooperation with these emerging donor governments and will contibute to the formulation of concrete policy  recommendations on how and where to promote cooperation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utveckla en f&#xf6;rdjupad f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;else av humanit&#xe4;rt bist&#xe5;nd fr&#xe5;n ett antal utvalda &apos;nya givare&apos;. Ge underlag f&#xf6;r en mer detaljerad analys av hinder och m&#xf6;jligheter f&#xf6;r samarbete med dessa nya givare och bidra till konkreta policyrekommendationer om hur samarbetet med dessa givare kan fr&#xe4;mjas.</narrative>
  </description>
